const kurdiTimings={},maherTimings={};function timingCache(){return $('audioReciter').value==='maher'?maherTimings:kurdiTimings;}function reciterName(){if(romanoNewReciters[$('audioReciter').value])return romanoNewReciters[$('audioReciter').value].name;return ({jazairi:'Yassen Al-Jazairi',maher:'Maher Al-Muaiqly',kurdi:'Raad Muhammed Al-Kurdi',fatih:'Fatih Çollak',kerim:'Kerim Öztürk',dosari:'Yasser Al-Dosari'})[$('audioReciter').value]}function marks(){const rec=$('audioReciter').value;if(romanoNewReciters[rec])return (romanoNewTimingCaches[rec]||{})[audioSura]||{};return ['kurdi','maher'].includes(rec)?(timingCache()[String(audioSura)]||{}):rec==='dosari'?((romanoNewTimingCaches.dosari||{})[audioSura]||{}):{}}function updateReciterNote(){const name=reciterName()||'Recitator';$('reciterSource').textContent=name+' · MP3Quran.net · Audio izvor: https://www.mp3quran.net/eng/api/ · Offline preuzimanje uz objavljene uslove izvora. Automatsko praćenje ajeta zavisi od dostupnih oznaka vremena.';}function findAyah(ms){let lo=1,hi=count(audioSura),next=1;const list=marks();while(lo<=hi){const mid=Math.floor((lo+hi)/2),item=list[String(mid)];if(!item){hi=mid-1;continue}if(ms>=item[0]){next=mid;lo=mid+1}else hi=mid-1}return next}
